    <p class="cjk" style="; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">为方便考生领取人事考试报名考试费票据，自</span></span></span><span style="font-family:Calibri, serif"><span style="font-family:仿宋, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">2025</span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">年起，我办组织的省公务员招录、专业技术人员资格（水平）类考试，统一提供电子票据，由考生自助下载打印。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height: 0.65cm; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">一、公务员招录考试发票</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:left;line-height: 0.65cm; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">考生直接登录“非税收入电子票据平台”（</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Calibri, serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">https://jsfs.yeepay.com/js-pre-nontax-app/invoice?merchantNo=10033291207</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">），输入姓名、身份证号、验证码查询并下载。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:center;line-height: 0.65cm; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-after: auto"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/202411/6bf1389132b844e0be3e763b3ceace94.png"></a><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/202411/507aaa6771a043e1854fe14124ef4447.png"></a><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/202411/046053f51e44488996561a195e77aff8.png"></a><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20256/45743887843b48418872e317d2ce9066.png"><img src="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/20256/45743887843b48418872e317d2ce9066.png" width="313" height="325" style="width: 313px; height: 325.632px;" /></a></p><p class="cjk" style="; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">二、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">咨询工程师考试发票</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="cjk" style="; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">电子票据由中国工程咨询协会统一开具。考生成功报名缴费后，按系统提示网上填写相关开票信息，具体内容详见当年度考试报名公告。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p class="cjk" style="; margin-bottom: 0cm"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">三、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="text-align: justify; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal;"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px">其他各类专业技术人员资格（水平）考试</span></span></span></span><span style="text-align: justify; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal;"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px">发票</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;line-height: 0.65cm; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">由我办统一开具电子发票。请考生于该项考试结束一周后下载电子发票，操作办法：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;line-height: 0.65cm; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-family:Calibri, serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="font-family:仿宋, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-style: normal">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">、考生直接登入网址</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;line-height: 0.65cm; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-family: 仿宋, serif; font-size: 18px; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap;">https://gov.yeepay.com/hn-nontax-hessian/openapi/sh/qbm?itemId=yzrs</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;line-height: 0.65cm; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 18px;">输入姓名、身份证号、验证码查询并下载。</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;line-height: 0.65cm; page-break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; page-break-after: auto"><span style="font-family:Calibri, serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-variant: normal"><span style="color:#333333"><span style="font-family:仿宋, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span style="font-style: normal">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">、考生登录“苏服办”</span></span></span></span><span style="font-family:Calibri, serif"><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋, serif"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">APP</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><span style="font-size:18px"><span style="font-style: normal">下载该项考试的电子发票（发票申领截止日期为下一年度该项考试报名前）。</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center; line-height: 0.65cm; break-inside: auto; orphans: 2; widows: 2; text-indent: 1.09cm; margin-bottom: 0cm; border: none; padding: 0cm; break-after: auto;"><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/202411/f2ba6f5f09674be0a8928b05f41c34ae.jpeg"></a><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/202411/893d5fca6c574c6eaf52150fea4878ea.jpeg"></a><a target="_Blank" href="/cms_files/filemanager/1923161018/picture/202411/1268974122ff4404a4f8332fc85f4e21.jpeg"></a><a target="_Blan